  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy Assistance - Ukraine Energy Support Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A $20 million contribution to enable the Ukraine Energy Support Fund to assist Ukraine to flexibly meet its highest priority heating and electricity needs. The Fund was established to purchase and safeguard the supply of Ukraine&apos;s energy sources, including fuel, equipment and repairs or reinforcements of critical infrastructure. Australia&apos;s contribution has not been earmarked to ensure that Ukraine&#x2019;s Energy Ministry is able to flexibly decide its priority energy needs.</narrative>
  </description>
